Alpha EEG Dataset
=================

Description
-----------
This dataset contains EEG recordings during an eyes-open/eyes-closed alpha rhythm paradigm.
Participants alternated between 30-second eyes-closed periods (to elicit alpha oscillations)
and 10-second eyes-open rest periods for 3 trials.

Equipment
---------
- EEG System: Nexstem (Board ID: Nex-Dev-00370, v27)
- DAQ: NI-DAQ USB-6008
- Sampling Rate: 1000 Hz
- Electrode Type: Dry electrodes
- EEG Channels: O1, O2 (occipital)
- Reference: Cz
- Ground: T7
- DRL: T8

Data Processing
---------------
Raw CSV files are provided without preprocessing.

Paradigm
--------
- Test condition: Eyes closed for 30 seconds
- Rest condition: Eyes open for 10 seconds
- Number of trials: 3
- Total paradigm duration: ~120 seconds

Recording Location
------------------
Anthriq Lab

Contact
-------
Anthriq 
